# 1. 创建盘点单（先查账面数量，再录入实际数量）
### 注意：bookQuantity不用传，系统自动从库存表读取
POST http://localhost:8080/stock-check/create
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsInVzZXJJZCI6MSwicmVhbE5hbWUiOiLlvKDkuIkiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODUzMzY0NTIsImV4cCI6MTc4NTM0MzY1Mn0.fBDXPUIJd-Wxw9Wbzk_ZJhaio8KF1wTQfieyhcICj5s
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "actualQuantity": 7,
  "reason": "少了一台，待查原因",
  "checkerId": 1,
  "checkDate": "2026-07-29"
}

### 2. 审核通过（把库存从8调整为7）
POST http://localhost:8080/stock-check/approve/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsInVzZXJJZCI6MSwicmVhbE5hbWUiOiLlvKDkuIkiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODUzMzcyMTMsImV4cCI6MTc4NTM0NDQxM30.1tfoZtdr1nnwJdU9aLXdf_sGoqMWAqsT2_MVnnlr7u8

### 3. 验证库存是否变成7
GET http://localhost:8080/inventory/list?warehouseId=1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsInVzZXJJZCI6MSwicmVhbE5hbWUiOiLlvKDkuIkiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODUzMzcyMTMsImV4cCI6MTc4NTM0NDQxM30.1tfoZtdr1nnwJdU9aLXdf_sGoqMWAqsT2_MVnnlr7u8


