### 登录获取Token
GET http://localhost:8080/login?username=admin&password=123456

### ========== 第一步：下载采购导入模板 ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/purchase/import-template
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token

### ========== 第二步：用Excel填写数据后上传导入 ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/purchase/import?purchaserId=1
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

file: @D:\projects\erp\采购单导入.xlsx

### ========== 第三步：查看导入后的草稿单列表 ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/purchase/draft-list?purchaserId=1
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token

### ========== 第四步：复核无误后，批量入库 ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/purchase/batch-stock-in?operatorId=1
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3]

### ========== 第五步：验证库存是否增加 ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/inventory/list?warehouseId=1
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token

### ========== 第六步：查看库存流水 ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/inventory/flow-export?warehouseId=1
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token


### ========== 销售导入对称流程 ==========

### 下载销售导入模板
GET http://localhost:8080/sales/import-template
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token

### 导入销售单
POST http://localhost:8080/sales/import?salesmanId=1
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

file: @D:\projects\erp\销售单导入.xlsx

### 查看草稿销售单
GET http://localhost:8080/sales/draft-list?salesmanId=1
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token

### 批量出库
POST http://localhost:8080/sales/batch-stock-out?operatorId=1
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3]

### 验证库存扣减
GET http://localhost:8080/inventory/list?warehouseId=1
Authorization: Bearer 你的Token


